   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 13.44,
   "to": 15.38,
   "sid": 7,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我们所用到的这几种手法啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 15.38,
   "to": 16.95,
   "sid": 8,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "有什么样的一个区别",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 16.95,
   "to": 19.85,
   "sid": 9,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "第一个我们会用到的是美国托马斯的这个",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 19.85,
   "to": 21.31,
   "sid": 10,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "解剖列车的警摩手法",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 21.31,
   "to": 24.48,
   "sid": 11,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "那第二个呢是意大利的这个FM的警摩手法",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 24.48,
   "to": 27.52,
   "sid": 12,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "那么首先我们先讲一下托马斯的啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 27.52,
   "to": 30.1,
   "sid": 13,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "这个筋膜手法它是怎么一个操作的方式",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 30.1,
   "to": 32.34,
   "sid": 14,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "在托马斯的这个筋膜手法里面呢",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 32.34,
   "to": 35.38,
   "sid": 15,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我们一般会用到这种半握的拳啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 35.38,
   "to": 36.9,
   "sid": 16,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "半握拳的这种形式",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 36.9,
   "to": 40.66,
   "sid": 17,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "然后以这个全面的地方去进行一个推推压",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 40.66,
   "to": 43.5,
   "sid": 18,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "然后呢还会用到我们这个手指",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 43.5,
   "to": 46.5,
   "sid": 19,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "然后还有一个是我们这个第二指关节",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 46.5,
   "to": 48.56,
   "sid": 20,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "那在做比较大肌肉群的时候",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 48.56,
   "to": 50.1,
   "sid": 21,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "比如说像我们的腿部啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 50.1,
   "to": 53.12,
   "sid": 22,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "也会用到我们的这个走的前方啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 53.12,
   "to": 54.739,
   "sid": 23,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "小臂的这个位置",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 54.739,
   "to": 57.759,
   "sid": 24,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "然后不管是哪一种这个手势啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 57.759,
   "to": 59.939,
   "sid": 25,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我们都是要推着这个筋膜",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 59.939,
   "to": 62.959,
   "sid": 26,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "就是蹭住筋膜向前滑动",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 62.959,
   "to": 66.559,
   "sid": 27,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "那比如说我们现在用半拳半握拳的这个方式啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 66.559,
   "to": 67.479,
   "sid": 28,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我们现在有模特",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 67.479,
   "to": 70.71,
   "sid": 29,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我们来跟大家去演示一下",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 70.71,
   "to": 71.19,
   "sid": 30,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "好",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 71.19,
   "to": 73.15,
   "sid": 31,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "现在我们以模特的小B为例",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 73.15,
   "to": 74.79,
   "sid": 32,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "去演示一下两种手法",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 74.79,
   "to": 76.93,
   "sid": 33,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "和这个筋膜枪的这个使用啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 76.93,
   "to": 78.29,
   "sid": 34,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "首先我们先来讲一下",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 78.29,
   "to": 80.47,
   "sid": 35,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "就是托马斯的这个解剖列车的手法",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 80.47,
   "to": 83.47,
   "sid": 36,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "那么第一个刚才我们讲到的是握这个半拳",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 83.47,
   "to": 84.79,
   "sid": 37,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "就是空心拳啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 84.79,
   "to": 86.67,
   "sid": 38,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "用这个全面去推",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 86.67,
   "to": 88.07,
   "sid": 39,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "那么在推的时候呢",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 88.07,
   "to": 90.65,
   "sid": 40,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我们一定是要用我们的重心压上去啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 90.65,
   "to": 91.59,
   "sid": 41,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "如果不用重心",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 91.59,
   "to": 94.11,
   "sid": 42,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "光用你的手臂垂直往上压的话呢",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 94.11,
   "to": 96.59,
   "sid": 43,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "很难去蹭到我们的筋膜啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 96.59,
   "to": 97.79,
   "sid": 44,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "有可能你的力量会重",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 97.79,
   "to": 98.99,
   "sid": 45,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "那么力量重的时候呢",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 98.99,
   "to": 100.39,
   "sid": 46,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "你就直接压到肌肉上面啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 100.39,
   "to": 101.09,
   "sid": 47,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "就很难推",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 101.09,
   "to": 103.2,
   "sid": 48,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "就感觉怎么样推不上去很涩",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 103.2,
   "to": 105.16,
   "sid": 49,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "那如果你太轻的话啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 105.16,
   "to": 105.92,
   "sid": 50,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "压的太轻的话",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 105.92,
   "to": 107.9,
   "sid": 51,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "就在表皮上面去啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 107.9,
   "to": 109.61,
   "sid": 52,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "运动那没有任何效果",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 109.61,
   "to": 112.87,
   "sid": 53,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "所以用重心自己人的重心压上去了以后呢",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 112.87,
   "to": 114.13,
   "sid": 54,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "正好可以蹭到筋膜",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 114.13,
   "to": 115.09,
   "sid": 55,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "蹭到筋膜的感觉",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 115.09,
   "to": 117.479,
   "sid": 56,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "就像我们小时候玩的那个水晶橡皮泥",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 117.479,
   "to": 118.959,
   "sid": 57,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "你去慢慢推它的时候",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 118.959,
   "to": 122.599,
   "sid": 58,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "你看那个皮肤它会有一个像波浪一样的啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 122.599,
   "to": 123.479,
   "sid": 59,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "这样的起伏",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 123.479,
   "to": 125.7,
   "sid": 60,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "顺着这个起伏往前啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 125.7,
   "to": 127.84,
   "sid": 61,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "所以呢我们用这个全面去推的时候",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 127.84,
   "to": 132.89,
   "sid": 62,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "首先呢从它的远端先把组直稍微向后拉一下",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 132.89,
   "to": 135.19,
   "sid": 63,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "好用身体的啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 135.19,
   "to": 136.29,
   "sid": 64,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "这个重心移上去",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 136.29,
   "to": 136.93,
   "sid": 65,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "压住了以后",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 136.93,
   "to": 139.06,
   "sid": 66,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "手臂伸直贴近身体",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 139.06,
   "to": 141.52,
   "sid": 67,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "顺着往前去走",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 141.52,
   "to": 143.42,
   "sid": 68,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "那么在走的过程当中呢",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 143.42,
   "to": 145.72,
   "sid": 69,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我们是身体的重心在往前移动啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 145.72,
   "to": 148.73,
   "sid": 70,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "那所以在移到最近端的时候",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 148.73,
   "to": 150.25,
   "sid": 71,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我压住它啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 150.25,
   "to": 152.13,
   "sid": 72,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "筋膜的这个力量也没有发生变化啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 152.13,
   "to": 153.85,
   "sid": 73,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "不会推着推着我的手出来了",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 153.85,
   "to": 156.01,
   "sid": 74,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "或者推着推着力量越来越大啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 156.01,
   "to": 157.25,
   "sid": 75,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "用重心压上去的时候",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 157.25,
   "to": 159.89,
   "sid": 76,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "那么这个力量它是不会改变的啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 159.89,
   "to": 164.33,
   "sid": 77,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "始终是让这个手臂上面像有一个波浪一样",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 164.33,
   "to": 165.39,
   "sid": 78,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "顺着往前去走",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 165.39,
   "to": 168.99,
   "sid": 79,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "那么用全面的时候到达底端的时候呢",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 168.99,
   "to": 174.41,
   "sid": 80,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我们会有一个向上挑起来的啊一个动作啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 174.41,
   "to": 176.27,
   "sid": 81,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "就像用勺子去挖西瓜的时候",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 176.27,
   "to": 177.95,
   "sid": 82,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "最后把它挖起来一样啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 177.95,
   "to": 178.79,
   "sid": 83,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "用全面去做的时候",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 178.79,
   "to": 181.39,
   "sid": 84,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "到最后一定有一个这个向上挑起来的",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 181.39,
   "to": 182.899,
   "sid": 85,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "一个动作啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 182.899,
   "to": 186.459,
   "sid": 86,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "好然后第二个呢我们是用手指用我们的指腹",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 186.459,
   "to": 188.67,
   "sid": 87,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "然后用指腹的时候呢",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 188.67,
   "to": 189.51,
   "sid": 88,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "还是一样",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 189.51,
   "to": 191.73,
   "sid": 89,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "先把它的阻值向后拉一下",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 191.73,
   "to": 195.61,
   "sid": 90,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "然后用另外一只手重心压上去啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 195.61,
   "to": 198.589,
   "sid": 91,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "把它固定在这个筋膜层",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 198.589,
   "to": 202.569,
   "sid": 92,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "然后向前去移动啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 202.569,
   "to": 203.929,
   "sid": 93,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "如果是比较涩的时候",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 203.929,
   "to": 205.609,
   "sid": 94,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我们可以用筋膜膏",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 207.3,
   "to": 209.12,
   "sid": 95,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "适量的筋膜膏涂在上面",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 209.12,
   "to": 210.74,
   "sid": 96,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "这样你更容易蹭住筋膜",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 210.74,
   "to": 213.02,
   "sid": 97,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "而且很容易向前滑动啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 213.02,
   "to": 216.54,
   "sid": 98,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "手指的话呢我们更能感觉到它筋膜的啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 216.54,
   "to": 218.69,
   "sid": 99,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "这个致密化啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 218.69,
   "to": 220.81,
   "sid": 100,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "是不是他这个地方筋膜有不顺畅的地方",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 220.81,
   "to": 221.85,
   "sid": 101,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "筋膜有结节的地方",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 223.05,
   "to": 224.17,
   "sid": 102,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "如果没有筋膜膏的话",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 224.17,
   "to": 227.08,
   "sid": 103,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "我们也可以用那个呃清水啊",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 227.08,
   "to": 228.28,
   "sid": 104,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "但是呢不能太多",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 228.28,
   "to": 229.68,
   "sid": 105,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "太多的话就容易打滑",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 229.68,
   "to": 232.01,
   "sid": 106,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "一滑了以后你就很难撑住这个筋膜",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 232.01,
   "to": 235.41,
   "sid": 107,
   "location": 2,
   "content": "然后另外一只手压上去以后稍微斜45度",
   "music": 0.0
  },
  {
   "from": 235.41,
